# DreamCalendars — Deploy policy (agents)

- **No staging** on this project — every deploy is production
- Do **not** run `scripts/dc-deploy.sh` unless the user explicitly asks to deploy
- When deploying, always use `--confirm`
- Run `scripts/dc-deploy-doctor.sh` first if SSH/deploy issues
- After HTML/CSS changes, suggest `scripts/dc-cf-purge.sh`
- Keep credentials in `.env`; never commit it or copy secrets into docs, logs, or responses
